  description: '2 Level 8 monsters

    Once per turn, you can also Xyz Summon "Dark
    Ceruvim Irisfil" by using 1 Xyz Monster you control that did not activate its
    effects in the Monster Zone this turn (transfer its materials). If this card
    is Xyz Summoned: You can activate this effect; during the Battle Phase of this
    turn, Xyz Monsters you control gain ATK equal to their Rank x 100. If this card
    would be destroyed by battle or card effect, you can detach 1 material from a
    monster you control instead. You can only use this effect of "Dark Ceruvim Irisfil"
    once per turn.'
